<title>GERMANY: Halla plans E.German cellulose plant.</title>
<headline>Halla plans E.German cellulose plant.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Halla Group plans to build a one billion mark cellulose plant in eastern Germany, Reinhardt Hoeppner, premier of the state of Saxony-Anhalt, said on Friday.</p>
<p>Germany's Harpen AG is a joint investor in the plant, which will be located in Zeitz, Hoeppner told Mid-German Radio.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-2609750</p>
